मय्यावेश्य मनो ये मां नित्ययुक्ता उपासते ।
श्रद्धया परयोपेतास्ते मे युक्ततमा मता: ॥ २ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3491,\"bb\":3076,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/12/2/b3076/\",\"body_value\":\"śrī-bhagavān uvāca
mayy āveśya mano ye māṁ
nitya-yuktā upāsate
śraddhayā parayopetās
te me yukta-tamā matāḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":3492,\"bb\":3077,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/12/2/b3077/\",\"shadow_value\":\"śrī-bhagavān uvāca – the Supreme Personality of Godhead said; mayi – upon Me; āveśya – fixing; manaḥ – the mind; ye – those who; mām – Me; nitya – always; yuktāḥ – engaged; upāsate – worship; śraddhayā – with faith; parayā – transcendental; upetāḥ – endowed; te – they; me – by Me; yukta-tamāḥ – most perfect in yoga; matāḥ – are considered.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"śrī-bhagavān uvāca\",\"translation\":\"the Supreme Personality of Godhead said\"},{\"word\":\"mayi\",\"translation\":\"upon Me\"},{\"word\":\"āveśya\",\"translation\":\"fixing\"},{\"word\":\"manaḥ\",\"translation\":\"the mind\"},{\"word\":\"ye\",\"translation\":\"those who\"},{\"word\":\"mām\",\"translation\":\"Me\"},{\"word\":\"nitya\",\"translation\":\"always\"},{\"word\":\"yuktāḥ\",\"translation\":\"engaged\"},{\"word\":\"upāsate\",\"translation\":\"worship\"},{\"word\":\"śraddhayā\",\"translation\":\"with faith\"},{\"word\":\"parayā\",\"translation\":\"transcendental\"},{\"word\":\"upetāḥ\",\"translation\":\"endowed\"},{\"word\":\"te\",\"translation\":\"they\"},{\"word\":\"me\",\"translation\":\"by Me\"},{\"word\":\"yukta-tamāḥ\",\"translation\":\"most perfect in yoga\"},{\"word\":\"matāḥ\",\"translation\":\"are considered\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":3493,\"bb\":3078,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/12/2/b3078/\",\"body_value\":\"The Supreme Personality of Godhead said: Those who fix their minds on My personal form and are always engaged in worshiping Me with great and transcendental faith are considered by Me to be most perfect.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3494,\"bb\":3079,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/12/2/b3079/\",\"body_value\":\"In answer to Arjuna’s question, Kṛṣṇa clearly says that he who concentrates upon His personal form and who worships Him with faith and devotion is to be considered most perfect in yoga. For one in such Kṛṣṇa consciousness there are no material activities, because everything is done for Kṛṣṇa. A pure devotee is constantly engaged. Sometimes he chants, sometimes he hears or reads books about Kṛṣṇa, or sometimes he cooks prasādam or goes to the marketplace to purchase something for Kṛṣṇa, or sometimes he washes the temple or the dishes – whatever he does, he does not let a single moment pass without devoting his activities to Kṛṣṇa. Such action is in full samādhi.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 12.2\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 12.2\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"29:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n2f:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"breadc